          "rawConfiguration": {
            "text": "Diagnostic log widgets need Db2 diag records in New Relic Logs. Enable either `COLLECT_DIAG_LOGS=true` on the integration (records are read remotely through `PD_GET_DIAG_HIST` and tailed from a local JSONL file by the agent) or the on-host `db2diag.log` tail example. These widgets are empty until one of them is on."
          }
